aic challenges section** (cat. 6): \"Despite challenges... continues to thrive\"\n- **Removed AI vocabulary** (cat. 7): \"additionally\", \"enhance\", \"showcase\", \"interplay\", \"intricate\", \"landscape\", \"pivotal\", \"testament\", \"underscore\", \"delve\"\n- **Added soul**: first-person opinion (\"I think that's right\"), specific tradeoffs with concrete examples, honest acknowledgment of when microservices aren't worth it", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "session_id": "71e8585b-e5db-4ed1-b1e3-94152f3ba06e", "total_cost_usd": 0.34139875, "usage": {"input_tokens": 5, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 41083, "cache_read_input_tokens": 79160, "output_tokens": 1801, "server_tool_use": {"web_search_requests": 0, "web_fetch_requests": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 41083}, "inference_geo": "", "iterations": [], "speed": "standard"}, "modelUsage": {"claude-opus-4-6": {"inputTokens": 5, "outputTokens": 1801, "cacheReadInputTokens": 79160, "cacheCreationInputTokens": 41083, "webSearchRequests": 0, "costUSD": 0.34139875, "contextWindow": 200000, "maxOutputTokens": 64000}}, "permission_denials": [], "terminal_reason": "completed", "fast_mode_state": "off", "uuid": "d1b86db3-6842-42be-8e0b-405c8150fb6e", "timestamp": "2026-05-04T15:38:59.898Z"}